# Performance Engineering

## Bundle budget
- `next build` — total JS < 200 KB compressed.
- Tránh bundle quá lớn: dùng `dynamic import()` cho heavy modal/component.

## Images
- Dùng `<Image>` (Next.js built-in). `alt` mô tả ngữ nghĩa.
- `placeholder="blur"` cho LCP ảnh.
- Format: `.avif`/`.webp`, width/height hint.

## Fonts
- `next/font/google`: `Be_Vietnam_Pro` (sans), `Playfair_Display` (display).
- `display: "swap"` để tránh FOIT.

## Animation performance (GSAP)
- Tween **chỉ** `transform`, `opacity`, `filter` — trigger GPU composite.
- `will-change: transform` nếu animation lâu dài.
- `transition: all` → chỉ định rõ property.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` — luôn wrap GSAP enter animations trong media query.

## Caching
- Route static: `revalidate: false` cho public pages.
- Middleware cache session trong 5 phút.